    "en": {
      "name": "Xenovader\u25b3 of Scarlet Naraka",
      "effect": "If this card is Normal or Special Summoned: Banish (face-down) the top 4 cards of your Deck. You can only use each of the following effects of \"Xenovader\u25b3 of Scarlet Naraka\" once per turn. If your opponent Special Summons a monster(s) (except during the Damage Step): You can Special Summon this card from your hand. During your opponent's Main Phase (Quick Effect): You can Special Summon 1 of your face-down banished Level 5 or higher \"Xenovader\u25b3\" monsters, also you cannot activate cards or effects for the rest of this turn, except \"Xenovader\u25b3\" cards or effects.",
      "official": false
    },
